      "claim": "AZD0837, which shares the benzyl amidoxime–azetidine amide core with the query, has measured absolute oral bioavailability of 22–55% in healthy young male volunteers (C03), 22–55% with Tmax 0.7–1.5 h after oral dosing (C08), 22–52% in humans (C33), and ~22–55% in an additional report (C64); all reported values are at or above the 20% threshold.",
